NOTE ON DATA LICENSING

This license covers the SOFTWARE ONLY — the CLI, SDKs, data pipeline, registry,
schemas and documentation in this repository.

It grants NO rights to any geographic DATA.

Generated data packages are licensed separately, per source, and are declared in
each package's manifest.json:

    manifest.license            e.g. "CC-BY-4.0"
    manifest.sources[].license  per-source license
    manifest.attribution        required attribution notices

Packages derived from OpenStreetMap are licensed ODbL 1.0, which imposes
share-alike obligations on the derived database.

Accepting this software license does not discharge any attribution obligation
for a data package. See LICENSING.md, or call Terra.attribution from the SDKs.
